# Deny by default — this file is for the published image (`Dockerfile`), whose COPYs are
# entrypoint.sh and tools/. Everything else, including the packages/ tree that only the dev image
# needs, is covered by the `*`. Dockerfile.dev has its own ignore file, so neither build carries the
# other's content: whitelist a new COPY here or the build fails loudly.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!tools/
